# The road west toward the crossroads, Tser Pool and Vallaki: the departure scene. It sets village_departed, which opens
# the village's west exit to the travel map (Phase 4), and the escort_ireena stage that Phase 4 reads.

~ start
if flag.village_departed
Narrator: The road west runs on into the mist. You have already said your goodbyes to this village; it didn't say any back.
-> END
endif
if flag.ireena_in_party
-> with_ireena
endif
Narrator: The road leaves the village between two leaning posts and runs west under dead trees toward the crossroads. Above it, on its cliff, the castle waits, patient as a creditor.
if flag.ireena_met and not flag.ireena_escort
Narrator: Behind you, a single lamp burns in an upstairs window of the burgomaster's house.
endif
* Set out west. -> depart_alone
* Not yet. -> END

~ with_ireena
cutscene ireena_looks_back
Narrator: The road leaves the village between two leaning posts and runs west toward the crossroads. Ireena stops at the last post and looks back once.
if flag.ismark_joins_escort
Ismark: Well. The Lesser goes adventuring. If I'm killed, tell the tavern I was the Greater. They won't check.
else
Ismark [sad]: This is as far as I go. Get her there. Bring her back one day, if there's anything to bring her back to.
endif
Ireena: I've never been past the crossroads. Father always said there was nothing out there but more Barovia. I'd like to see if he was right.
if flag.madam_eva_rumor
Ireena: Tser Pool first, then. If this Madam Eva reads cards for strangers, she can read a few for me.
endif
if flag.ireena_destination == "krezk"
Ireena: Vallaki first, then Krezk. Farther than anyone in my family has ever walked.
endif
* Set out west. -> depart
* Not yet. -> END

~ depart
set village_departed
join ireena
if flag.ismark_joins_escort
join ismark
endif
quest escort_ireena departed
Narrator: You walk out of the village of Barovia with the burgomaster's daughter between you. Behind you, a shutter opens a crack, and closes again.
-> END

~ depart_alone
if flag.ismark_met and not flag.ireena_escort
set ireena_escort = "declined"
quest escort_ireena declined
endif
set village_departed
Narrator: The village falls behind you, shutter by shutter, and nobody waves. Somewhere ahead the road forks, and from its cliff the castle watches you choose.
-> END
